  2+++65E4              ; Project127 ATM physical-page manager
  3+++65E4              ; ATM RAM: 64 x 16 KiB pages, mapped through four 16 KiB CPU windows.
  4+++65E4              ;
  5+++65E4              ; Public request ABI:
  6+++65E4              ;   atm_mem_request_length[4]  UINT32 byte length
