 10+++65E4              ; ALLOC returns a page-aligned contiguous physical extent. The caller sees
 11+++65E4              ; a 32-bit byte offset; page numbers and the 16 KiB mapping window are private.
 12+++65E4              ; READ/WRITE/STREAM operations will use the same mapper and split internally.
 13+++65E4              ;
 14+++65E4              ; Reserved pages are based on the Project112 ATM2+ memory map and the P127
 15+++65E4              ; boot runtime: page 0 system/BASIC map, page 2 host stack, page 5 host image,
